WEBVTT

00:12:57.627 --> 00:13:00.680
S tim kažete kako imate povjerenja u sebe

00:13:00.680 --> 00:13:03.715
da se nosite sa životnim izazovima,

00:13:03.715 --> 00:13:06.640
i dobro znate

00:13:06.640 --> 00:13:09.351
da se ne morate s tim součavati sami.

00:13:09.351 --> 00:13:10.733
Hvala vam.

00:13:10.733 --> 00:13:20.014
(aplauz)

00:13:20.014 --> 00:13:22.912
Chris Anderson: To je stvarno nevjerovatno šta nam govorite.

00:13:22.912 --> 00:13:27.017
Čini se nevjerovatno da uvjerenje o stresu

00:13:27.017 --> 00:13:31.500
može toliko toga da uradi za duzinu zivota.